  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAFOD Support to Sudan HIV &amp; AIDS Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a 3 year project aimed at facilitating capacity building initiatives of key persons responsible for the delivery of the programme at national and state levels, including facilitation of some of CAFOD&#x2019;s PO learning visits to inform country support with partners as well as facilitation for in-country support visits to partners. The capacity building initiatives will directly address the organizational and operational capacity needs of the partners both at national and state levels and equip them with the necessary HIV&amp;AIDS planning and management skills to effectively implement and support the various HIV&amp;AIDS responses at national and state levels with improved coordination with other key stakeholders. 

CAFOD will commit to implement the project activities on behalf of Sudanaid (SCBC) in order to provide capacity building support to national partners.</narrative>
  </description>
